    "traits": "Consumable Herb Uncommon",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: great libraries, arcane capitals and ancient academies.\n\nMindcrown ivy is a pale climbing plant whose crown-shaped leaves arrange themselves in ascending rings around old libraries, academies and towers of learning. Ink placed upon a fresh leaf separates into precise lines, while spoken words nearby sometimes leave fleeting patterns in its veins. When steeped into a clear, almost tasteless tea, the leaves sharpen concentration to an unnatural degree. For 1 hour, you gain a +2-item bonus to checks made as part of Concentrate or Mental actions and to Will saving throws against Mental effects.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
